# Text files are stored and checked out with LF everywhere, including Windows
# (whose Git defaults to CRLF checkouts). Prettier (.editorconfig) and the
# PLATFORM_CAPABILITIES.md sync test compare against LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-exact files. PDF fixtures in particular must never be converted: some
# are plain text (header-only.pdf, not-a-pdf.pdf) and would otherwise be.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.wasm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
